# Force LF everywhere: the workspace ships byte-exact pinned vectors (conformance
# vectors, §13.4 tripwires, serde round-trips) whose byte-identity must NOT
# depend on the platform's newline convention. Git autocrlf would rewrite .rs
# sources to CRLF on Windows checkouts and break those byte-exact assertions.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf